                                "sense_id": "0705a86f-1ef6-3ce5-abb3-b52a089d61dd",
                                "text": "Velen vinden dat onnodig verlies van dierenlevens moet worden voorkomen.",
                                "translation": "Many people are of the opinion that unnecessarily loss of animal lives is to be prevented.",
